---
import { getEntry } from 'astro:content'; import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const page = (await getEntry('pages', 'about'))!; const about = page.data.about!;
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const portraitSrc = `${base}${about.portrait.src.slice(1)}`;
---
<BaseLayout title="About — Katerina" description={about.intro}><section class="shell page-intro about-grid"><div class="hero-image"><img src={portraitSrc} alt={about.portrait.alt} /></div><div><span class="eyebrow">About me</span><h1>About me</h1><p class="lede">{about.intro}</p><a class="text-link" href="#">Download CV <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section><section class="shell section values"><span class="eyebrow">My values</span><div class="value-grid"><article><h2>Structure with Purpose</h2><p>I believe structure should support people and creativity, not restrict them. Clear processes and organization help teams feel safe, aligned and confident to do their best work.</p></article><article><h2>Accountability and Trust</h2><p>I value taking responsibility, following through on commitments and being someone teams can rely on. Accountability builds trust and keeps projects moving forward with clarity.</p></article><article><h2>Curiosity & Growth</h2><p>Im motivated by curiosity, continuous learning and self improvement. I value feedback as a tool for growth and enjoy reflecting on my work to improve both myself and the teams I collaborate with.</p></article></div></section><section class="shell section about-details"><div><span class="eyebrow">My Strenghts</span><h2>Skills</h2><ul class="expertise">{about.expertise.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul><p>Project coordination & delivery<br />Process design & project flow<br />Time & priority management<br />Stakeholder communication<br />Team facilitation & alignment<br />Creative - technical collaboration</p></div><div><span class="eyebrow">Tools</span><h2>Tools</h2><p>Project & collaboration : Trello, Jira, Miro, Figma<br />Design & Creation : Canva, Figma, Blender, Unity<br />Organisation & Communication : Microsoft Office / Google workspace</p><div class="about-icons"><img src={`${base}portfolio-assets/figma-source/about/image.png`} alt="Figma board icon" /><img src={`${base}portfolio-assets/figma-source/about/image-02.png`} alt="Figma board icon" /><img src={`${base}portfolio-assets/figma-source/about/image-03.png`} alt="Figma board icon" /></div></div></section><section class="shell section"><span class="eyebrow">Beyond work</span><h2>Beyond work</h2><div class="beyond-grid"><article><img src={`${base}portfolio-assets/figma-source/about/about-photo-2943.jpg`} alt="Organizing events" /><h3>Organizing events</h3><p>I enjoy bringing people together through well-structured, thoughtful experiences. I co-organised a Friendsgiving event with a classmate, where I was responsible for coordination and decoration. The event brought together people from different backgrounds, each contributing traditional dishes and sharing them in a relaxed, welcoming setting. It was rewarding to see how good planning and care can turn a simple idea into a meaningful shared moment.</p></article><article><img src={`${base}portfolio-assets/figma-source/about/about-photo-2941-1.jpg`} alt="Organize trips & exploring the swedish heritage" /><h3>Organize trips & exploring the swedish heritage</h3><p>I often organise small trips with friends to explore Sweden’s cultural and natural heritage. Experiencing the country you live in helps build a deeper sense of belonging and openness toward different cultures. Recently, we visited the Ekeby Oak (Ekebyhovseken) in Ekerö — the largest living deciduous tree in Sweden, estimated to be around 500 years old. Standing alone yet enduring, it was a powerful reminder of resilience, presence, and the impact of carving your own path — values I carry both personally and professionally.</p></article><article><img src={`${base}portfolio-assets/figma-source/about/about-photo-4314.jpg`} alt="Volunteering" /><h3>Volunteering</h3><p>Volunteering is an important part of how I engage with my community. Most recently, I volunteered with the Event Field Team during the Stockholm Film Festival. I supported general event operations, assisted guests, and helped ensure activities ran smoothly in a fast-paced environment. The experience strengthened my ability to stay organised, adaptable, and calm under pressure.</p></article><article><img src={`${base}portfolio-assets/figma-source/about/about-photo-1092.jpg`} alt="Baking" /><h3>Baking</h3><p>Baking is a creative outlet for me. I enjoy experimenting with new recipes and developing my own, paying attention to both flavour and presentation. It’s a process that rewards patience, precision, and creativity — qualities I value in all areas of my work</p></article></div><div class="about-photo-strip"><img src={`${base}portfolio-assets/figma-source/about/about-photo-2956.jpg`} alt="Personal image from the Figma board" /><img src={`${base}portfolio-assets/figma-source/about/about-photo-7630.jpg`} alt="Personal image from the Figma board" /></div></section></BaseLayout>
